      "questions": [
        {
          "id": "695b81fe471cd7432e79acdb",
          "question": "<p>If the parabolas \\( y^{2}=4 k x(k&gt;0) \\) and \\( y^{2}=4(x-1) \\) do&nbsp;not have a common normal other than the axis of&nbsp;parabola, then \\( k \\in \\)</p>",
          "image_url": null,
          "images": [],
          "type": "mcq",
          "options": [
            "<p>\\( (0,1) \\)</p>",
            "<p>\\( (2, \\infty) \\)</p>",
            "<p>\\( (3, \\infty) \\)</p>",
            "<p>\\( (0, \\infty) \\)</p>"
          ],
          "correct": 0
        },
        {
          "id": "695b81fd471cd7432e79ac99",
          "question": "<p>At a point \\( P \\) on the parabola \\( y^{2}=4 a x \\), tangent of&nbsp;normal are drawn. Tangent intersects the \\( x \\)-axis at \\( Q \\) and normal intersects the curve at \\( R \\) such that chord \\( P R \\) subtends an angle of \\( 90^{\\circ} \\) at its vertex. Then:</p>",
          "image_url": null,
          "images": [],
          "type": "mcq",
          "options": [
            "<p>\\( P Q=2 a \\sqrt{6} \\)</p>",
            "<p>\\( P R=6 a \\sqrt{3} \\)</p>",
            "<p>area of \\( \\triangle P Q R=18 \\sqrt{2} a^{2} \\)</p>",
            "<p>\\( P Q=3 a \\sqrt{2} \\)</p>"
          ],
          "correct": 0
        },
        {
          "id": "695b81fe471cd7432e79acd6",
          "question": "<p><math style=\"font-family: stix;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle mathsize=\"16px\"><mi>l</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mstyle></math> is the equation of the chord <math style=\"font-family: stix;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle mathsize=\"16px\"><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi></mstyle></math> of <math style=\"font-family: stix;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle mathsize=\"16px\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></mstyle></math> whose focus is <math style=\"font-family: stix;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle mathsize=\"16px\"><mi>S</mi></mstyle></math>. If <math style=\"font-family: stix;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle mathsize=\"16px\"><mi>P</mi><mi>S</mi></mstyle></math> and <math style=\"font-family: stix;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle mathsize=\"16px\"><mi>Q</mi><mi>S</mi></mstyle></math> meet the parabola again at <math style=\"font-family: stix;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle mathsize=\"16px\"><mi>R</mi></mstyle></math> and <math style=\"font-family: stix;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle mathsize=\"16px\"><mi>T </mi></mstyle></math>&nbsp;respectively, then slope of <math style=\"font-family: stix;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle mathsize=\"16px\"><mi>R</mi><mi>T</mi></mstyle></math> is</p>",
          "image_url": null,
          "images": [],
          "type": "mcq",
          "options": [
            "<p><math style=\"font-family: stix;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle mathsize=\"16px\"><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>m</mi></mfrac></mstyle></math></p>",
            "<p><math style=\"font-family: stix;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle mathsize=\"16px\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>m</mi></mfrac></mstyle></math></p>",
            "<p><math style=\"font-family:stix\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi></mfrac></math></p>",
            "<p>None of these</p>"
          ],
          "correct": 0
        },
        {
