          "question": "<p>If \\( 2 x+3 y=\\alpha, x-y=\\beta \\) and \\( k x+15 y=r \\) are 3 concurrent normal of parabola \\( y^{2}=\\lambda x \\) then value of \\( k \\) is</p>",
