        {
          "id": "695b81fd471cd7432e79ac9f",
          "question": "<p>The normals at three points \\( P, Q, R \\) of the parabola \\( y^{2}=4 a x \\) meet in \\( (h, k) \\). The centroid of \\( \\triangle P Q R \\) lies&nbsp;on:</p>",
          "image_url": null,
