            "<p>&nbsp;\\( y=a \\)</p>"
          ],
          "correct": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "695b81fd471cd7432e79aca5",
          "question": "<p>Let \\( L \\) be a normal to the parabola \\( y^{2}=4 x \\). If \\( L \\) passes through the point \\( (9,6) \\), then \\( L \\) is given by:</p>",
          "image_url": null,
          "images": [],
          "type": "mcq",
          "options": [
            "<p>\\( y-x+3=0 \\)</p>",
            "<p>\\( y+3 x-33=0 \\)</p>",
            "<p>\\( y+x-15=0 \\)</p>",
            "<p>&nbsp;\\( y-2 x+12=0 \\)</p>"
          ],
          "correct": 0
        },
        {
          "id": "695b81fd471cd7432e79aca2",
          "question": "<p>The number of distinct normals that can be drawn from \\( (-2,1) \\) to the parabola \\( y^{2}-4 x-2 y-3=0 \\) is</p>",
          "image_url": null,
          "images": [],
          "type": "mcq",
          "options": [
            "<p>1</p>",
